question: What are the names and release years for all the songs of the youngest singer?, query SPARQL:

execution_result.cleaned_query:
SELECT ?name ?releaseYear
WHERE {
  ?singer :singer\#age ?age .
  ?singer :singer\#song_name ?name .
  ?singer :singer\#song_release_year ?releaseYear .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS {
    ?otherSinger :singer\#age ?otherAge .
    FILTER (?otherAge < ?age)
  }
}

