question: List all song names by singers above the average age., query SPARQL:

execution_result.cleaned_query:
SELECT DISTINCT ?song_name
WHERE {
  # Calculate the average age of all singers
  {
    SELECT (AVG(?age) AS ?avgAge)
    WHERE {
      ?singer :singer\#age ?age .
    }
  }

  # Find singers whose age is above the average
  ?singer :singer\#age ?age .
  FILTER (?age > ?avgAge)

  # Retrieve the song names of these singers
  ?singer :singer\#song_name ?song_name .
}

