question: Show the stadium names without any concert., query SPARQL:

execution_result.cleaned_query:
SELECT ?stadium_name
WHERE {
  ?stadium rdf:type :stadium .
  ?stadium :stadium\#name ?stadium_name .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS {
    ?concert rdf:type :concert .
    ?concert :concert\#ref-stadium_id ?stadium .
  }
}

